posts.body:
@ATT_Turan
I will definitely check out your project after I spend some more time with this one. You have definitely helped me out in the past and I am more than happy to return the favor in whatever limited way that I can.
@Prescott
Now that I know I am the only one currently testing for you and providing feedback, I will try to test a bit more regularly.
To that end, with the updates you are making, do I need to start a new game for them to take effect or will the Save files also include the changes? I'm not really sure how that works. I know sometimes I see where you are told you have to start a new game and sometimes not.
